================================================================================
Plain-Language Summary (for convenience only; the terms below govern)
================================================================================

You may fork, modify, host, and run this code, and you may collect money from
it. In return, you must:

  1. Pay 30% of your Gross Revenue back to Mark Jen, the original author.
  2. Keep public beaches on your host connectable, shareable, and browsable
     into Beechshore (https://beechshore.com) and interoperable with beaches
     on other hosts.
  3. Keep this license and copyright notice intact on all copies and forks.

Non-commercial use that collects no revenue is free (30% of $0 is $0).

